        <item>
            <title><![CDATA[Linking Innovation and Entrepreneurship: Real-World Challenges in High-Cost Economies]]></title>
            <link>https://kerostig.com/call/elsevier-linking-innovation-and-entrepreneurship-real-world-challenges-in-high-cost-economies-2</link>
            <guid>elsevier-linking-innovation-and-entrepreneurship-real-world-challenges-in-high-cost-economies-2</guid>
            <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 10:27:21 GMT</pubDate>
            <content:encoded><![CDATA[<div>
    
    
    <p>This special issue calls for papers examining the intersection of innovation and entrepreneurship in high-cost economies. High-cost economies face unique challenges in maintaining competitiveness while managing elevated operational expenses, regulatory burdens, and labor costs. The issue seeks to understand how entrepreneurs and innovators navigate these constraints and leverage them as opportunities for creating sustainable business models and competitive advantages.</p>
    
    
    
    <h2>Timeline</h2>
    <ul>
        
        <li>January 31, 2025: Submission deadline</li>
        
    </ul>
    
    
</div>]]></content:encoded>
